# Build

- App lives in `Site/` (Next.js 14). This PC: `localhost:3010` only. LAN browsers (Mac, phones): Debian `http://192.168.0.223:3010`. localhost `/admin` pushes its inbox downstairs; sniff merges by id and never overwrites a local-only note. Prefer `ops/enable-campus-user.sh` here; `ops/enable-debian-host.sh` downstairs. Push `ops/sync-to-debian.sh`, pull `ops/pull-from-debian.sh`. Live public host 404s `/lab`.
- Plots registry: `greenhouse/plots.json` (`party`: client|studio) + `memory/greenhouse.md` (keep in sync)
- One Docker service per **hosted** plot. Isolation over shared roots. Do not rebase a **live** plot onto a hub path. Local lab on `:3010` may frame houses under `/go/{slug}/` — see `ops/lab.md`.
- Auth cookie `dln_session`; accounts in `_meta/accounts/` (gitignored)
- Studio access on every plot host is the Design Lab North owner/studio logins (Ewan, Dave). Client live-site books stay theirs.
- Gate: `/api/auth/gate?plot=` — 200 allow, 302 greenhouse story
- No in-site designer UI. Cursor is the desk. Local `/admin` is the campus building site. `/lab/{slug}/admin` is that unit’s Cursor. Not a public CMS.
- Unit apps on this PC run while occupied and sleep at zero. The campus on `:3010` stays up (`ops/campus.service`). Always-on host is Debian downstairs (`ops/debian-host.md`).
- Do not invent a logo. Mark lives in `Site/public/brand/dln-*.png`. Paper uses ink plate, ink uses white plate.
- Grounds are **Paper** / **Ink** (not light/dark). Control is the 45° cut, never a sun/moon.
- Type is [Aktiv Grotesk](https://fonts.adobe.com/fonts/aktiv-grotesk/) from Adobe Fonts (Dave’s web project). Do not self-host foundry files we do not own. Chamfer interactive edges. No pills, no card shadows, no gradient orbs.
- Public plot copy is DLN-voice, never a deep-link to the client’s current live site.
- VPS facts: `ops/vps.md`. Deploy files: `deploy/`.

